Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.73,0:00:06.15,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The overall result of SoLaMi SMILE and Dressing Pafé's competitions so far...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.60,0:00:09.61,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Is 50-50! But some day, I'll put an end to that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.04,0:00:11.43,PriPara,,0,0,0,,How about not just "some day"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.43,0:00:13.90,PriPara,,0,0,0,,but at the upcoming Paprika Academy School Festival,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:16.44,PriPara,,0,0,0,,the Paprika Festival-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.44,0:00:18.12,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Paprika Festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.46,0:00:20.50,PriPara,,0,0,0,,We'll have a contest event-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.50,0:00:23.91,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Put screens all over the grounds and broadcast it live.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.91,0:00:25.83,PriPara,,0,0,0,,And the audience there will decide who wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.83,0:00:26.96,PriPara,,0,0,0,,That's what I like to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.54,0:00:31.17,PriPara,,0,0,0,,But I can't imagine Headmistress Ookanda approving that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.86,0:00:36.39,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The grounds are for the middle school's events. She's in charge of the elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.39,0:00:38.60,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Received and understood.
