Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.28,0:00:41.06,PriPara,,0,0,0,,And as such...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:44.16,PriPara,,0,0,0,,we'll broadcast our shows at the Paprika Festival,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.16,0:00:48.02,PriPara,,0,0,0,,and have a contest between SoLaMi SMILE and Dressing Pafé.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.39,0:00:49.86,PriPara,,0,0,0,,That's right-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.21,0:00:53.53,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Let's go all out. Let it {\i1}GO!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.53,0:00:56.64,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Let's Pop Step Get that victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:00:57.95,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.95,0:01:00.91,PriPara,,0,0,0,,[catchphrases intensifying]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.82,0:02:40.93,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Hello. It's everyone's beloved elder brother, Akai Meganii.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.59,0:02:44.22,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I am here to present you a new song.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.22,0:02:45.14,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Ta-dah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.88,0:02:58.16,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The new song is now registered in your PriPasses. The title: "Happy Hop Lucky" {"Happy Pa-Lucky" Stop it with the portpunteaus, you magnificent bastard.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.86,0:03:00.74,PriPara,,0,0,0,,And I took the liberty of booking your upcoming event.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.48,0:03:04.95,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I know you'll make my heart skip a beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.27,0:03:06.79,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.20,0:03:07.95,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Well, then:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.44,0:03:11.69,PriPara,,0,0,0,,A new song from me, to you:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.69,0:03:12.50,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Ta-da-da-dah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.39,0:03:18.21,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Don't be shy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.01,0:03:22.63,PriPara,,0,0,0,,New song registered! Hot off the press!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.63,0:03:26.78,PriPara,,0,0,0,,We'll win for sure with this! More like SoLaMi {\i1}Frown{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.78,0:03:28.07,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Right, Leona?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.07,0:03:29.98,PriPara,,0,0,0,,If you say so, Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.36,0:03:33.60,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The title: "Change My World"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.60,0:03:37.40,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to having my heart melted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.86,0:03:38.90,PriPara,,0,0,0,,We'll do our best!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.24,0:03:40.37,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.86,0:03:43.82,PriPara,,0,0,0,,We'll definitely...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.10,0:03:44.87,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Win!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.26,0:03:45.85,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.85,0:03:48.17,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.70,0:03:53.79,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I have registered a number of new coords in honor of your new song.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.13,0:03:56.81,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Go on through the gate to try them on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.81,0:03:58.21,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Thanks lots.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.91,0:04:00.67,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.59,0:04:06.80,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The Giraffe Dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.80,0:04:09.81,PriPara,,0,0,0,,So cute! Roar!{Technically actually whatever noise an elephant makes.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.11,0:04:12.76,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I don't think giraffes sound like that-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.77,0:04:15.46,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Fluffy Penguin Dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.46,0:04:17.00,PriPara,,0,0,0,,This poncho is like wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.00,0:04:19.32,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Roar! Roar!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.44,0:04:19.32,PriPara ALT,,0,0,0,,Roar, roar... Are you even listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.84,0:04:22.58,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The Rainbow Diamond Dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.58,0:04:25.23,PriPara,,0,0,0,,My {\i1}heart{\i0} feels fancy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.09,0:04:27.73,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The Forest Girl Dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.73,0:04:31.45,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Fantastic. The wind is calling for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.45,0:04:33.54,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The Dream Attendant Dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.54,0:04:35.65,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I feel like I can fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.33,0:04:37.72,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Star Dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.72,0:04:39.96,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I'll be the brightest star in the idol sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.96,0:04:41.48,PriPara,,0,0,0,,You're shining-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.80,0:04:43.06,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The Animal Dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.06,0:04:45.52,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Careful, I bite! Roar!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.52,0:04:47.00,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Wild-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.56,0:04:49.32,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The Sparkling Ramune Dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.32,0:04:51.68,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Ramune? How refreshing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.68,0:04:53.10,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Cool-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.24,0:04:58.27,PriPara,,0,0,0,,None of these could lose to Dressing Pafé-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.66,0:05:03.56,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Come on then! Let's try them all on and decide on which ones to use today!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.56,0:05:05.24,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Cacacapisce!{kind of an unfortunate way to do that. alternative: ca pee pee pisce}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.55,0:05:11.08,PriPara,,0,0,0,,So you're doing a show at the Paprika Festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.35,0:05:13.58,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Oh, you've already heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.58,0:05:16.77,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I know everything about PriPara.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.77,0:05:21.23,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I really would have preferred a Pink Actress show, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.23,0:05:24.11,PriPara,,0,0,0,,But I guess your show will have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.11,0:05:25.12,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.12,0:05:26.51,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.56,0:05:33.77,PriPara,,0,0,0,,A PriPara concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.77,0:05:36.62,PriPara,,0,0,0,,A contest between SoLaMi SMILE and Dressing Pafé?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.62,0:05:38.81,PriPara,,0,0,0,,And exclusively for our school!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.81,0:05:39.86,PriPara,,0,0,0,,VIP treatment!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.86,0:05:41.90,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Seriously? Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.22,0:05:44.68,PriPara,,0,0,0,,See how excited everyone is, Lala?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.68,0:05:45.93,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I can't wait either!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.93,0:05:47.15,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Nao!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.73,0:05:51.76,PriPara,,0,0,0,,We'll make it the best concert ever, for the best festival ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.76,0:05:54.12,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I'll be cheering for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.12,0:05:56.52,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Ding dong dong ding!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:06:00.31,PriPara,,0,0,0,,To everyone on the Disciplinary Committee and the Paprika Festival organizers:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.31,0:06:02.60,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Come to my office at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.60,0:06:05.46,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Ding dong dong dong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.64,0:06:13.10,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Now, about this PriPara concert at the Paprika Festival...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.66,0:06:16.40,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I absolutely cannot allow this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.40,0:06:18.31,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I would like to point out, Headmistress,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.97,0:06:22.90,PriPara,,0,0,0,,that the school grounds are reserved for the middle school branch's events.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.90,0:06:23.81,PriPara,,0,0,0,,And as such...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.81,0:06:32.19,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Having the approval of the middle school branch's Principal, it won't need {\i1}my{\i0}, Ookanda Gloria's, approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.19,0:06:33.88,PriPara,,0,0,0,,That's what you're saying, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.88,0:06:34.49,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.80,0:06:37.98,PriPara,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She stands firm even against headmistress Ookanda!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.98,0:06:40.05,PriPara,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's our committee head!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.22,0:06:45.91,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Seems you're unaware of our rule 87.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.91,0:06:50.39,PriPara,,0,0,0,,87? "Students may not under any circumstances draw graffiti on the statue of the founder."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.39,0:06:51.68,PriPara,,0,0,0,,That's not the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.68,0:06:56.18,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Impossible, I have memorized the entire rulebook word for word.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.18,0:06:57.14,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I'm certain that was correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.17,0:07:00.99,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Oh, pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.99,0:07:04.82,PriPara,,0,0,0,,There are a number of rules you're unaware of.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.33,0:07:06.03,PriPara,,0,0,0,,That is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.44,0:07:08.55,PriPara,,0,0,0,,A rulebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.55,0:07:10.49,PriPara,,0,0,0,,There's an additional rulebook?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.49,0:07:12.30,PriPara,,0,0,0,,There is indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.30,0:07:15.12,PriPara,,0,0,0,,And these rules are known as:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.12,0:07:17.95,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The Principal's Rules!
