Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.48,0:07:24.84,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The Principal's Rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.73,0:07:29.90,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Full of rules only I, the headmistress, know!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.90,0:07:32.05,PriPara,,0,0,0,,And article 87:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.05,0:07:38.77,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Paprika Festival events must obtain approval from both principal teachers regardless of location.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.07,0:07:38.77,Article,,0,0,0,,{\fad(458,0)\blur1\an1\pos(808,589.334)\fscx89\fscy84}Article 87 \NPaprika Festival events \Nmust obtain approval \Nfrom both principal teachers \Nregardless of location!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.58,0:07:40.97,PriPara,,0,0,0,,How can that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.97,0:07:44.48,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Only you know? That's not playing fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.48,0:07:48.19,PriPara,,0,0,0,,As such, I veto the PriPara concert idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.59,0:07:51.73,PriPara,,0,0,0,,B-But the announcement has been made!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.73,0:07:52.62,PriPara,,0,0,0,,And the posters are...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.62,0:07:55.36,PriPara,,0,0,0,,You seem very invested in this, Minami.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.36,0:07:58.87,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Could it be that {\i1}you{\i0} have been going to PriPara?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.88,0:08:02.20,PriPara,,0,0,0,,That is irrelevant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.20,0:08:05.47,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I am simply looking to make the Paprika Festival as successful as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.47,0:08:07.59,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The students as well as their friends from elsewhere are looking forward to...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.59,0:08:10.69,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Neither PriPara nor friends are things our students need!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.69,0:08:14.01,PriPara,,0,0,0,,When I say "denied!" I {\i1}mean{\i0} denied.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.91,0:08:22.24,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Canceled? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.24,0:08:23.44,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.08,0:08:25.65,PriPara,,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.57,0:08:32.12,PriPara,,0,0,0,,After all the talk of having it under control...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.09,0:08:34.61,PriPara,,0,0,0,,You really {\i1}are{\i0} all talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.25,0:08:37.03,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Grasping at straws.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.03,0:08:41.50,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I'm out of ideas as well. So that's the end of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.88,0:08:46.42,PriPara,,0,0,0,,M-Minami...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.13,0:09:04.94,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I was really looking forward to the concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.94,0:09:07.15,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Leona?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.64,0:09:09.93,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Not even because I wanted us to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.59,0:09:15.78,PriPara,,0,0,0,,For all the elementary schoolers and boys who can't come to PriPara themselves...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.30,0:09:19.37,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I was hoping we could show them what it's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.69,0:09:21.83,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.78,0:09:36.78,PriPara,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.92,0:09:49.25,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Mi-Mireille!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.30,0:09:51.15,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.83,0:09:58.03,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I'm, uh... Mega-little-brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.03,0:09:59.62,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Mega-little-brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.95,0:10:06.58,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I want to see your concert! I mean the SoLaMi SMILE concert at Paprika Festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.87,0:10:08.96,PriPara,,0,0,0,,You know I'm an idol?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.96,0:10:10.29,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Please don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.73,0:10:11.87,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Head Disciplinarian...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.87,0:10:13.64,PriPara,,0,0,0,,No, Mireille!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.64,0:10:19.21,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I know you can find a way to make it happen in spite of the Principal's new rulebook!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.21,0:10:21.76,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Show us your brilliance!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.27,0:10:28.25,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Of course I will! I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.25,0:10:32.49,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I haven't given up. I've just been running calculations on how to turn it around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.52,0:10:35.99,PriPara,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes. Calculating.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.27,0:10:46.16,PriPara,,0,0,0,,And I have the perfect answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.63,0:10:50.44,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Mega-little-brother, go tell the rest of the committee
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.44,0:10:53.03,PriPara,,0,0,0,,that we're helping make the concert happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.03,0:10:54.02,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Yes ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.11,0:10:56.84,PriPara,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thank you, Amamiya.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.50,0:10:59.80,PriPara,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good luck, Mireille!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.44,0:11:01.80,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Head Disciplinarian?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.15,0:11:06.36,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I have a way to get back at Ookanda fair and square!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.36,0:11:07.22,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.96,0:11:09.26,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.07,0:11:12.73,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Miss Meganee, we have a favor to ask!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.27,0:11:14.69,PriPara,,0,0,0,,You too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.59,0:11:16.65,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Seems like...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.65,0:11:19.36,PriPara,,0,0,0,,We've reached the same conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.90,0:11:24.17,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Your request is regarding the Paprika Festival PriPara broadcast, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.17,0:11:25.08,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.75,0:11:40.11,PriPara,,0,0,0,,What a marvelous Paprika Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.11,0:11:44.26,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I feel great after crushing that PriPara concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.59,0:11:52.14,PriPara,,0,0,0,,To everyone enjoying the Paprika Festival:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.14,0:11:55.02,PriPara,,0,0,0,,We are starting a special event soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.43,0:11:57.23,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Special event?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.23,0:12:00.44,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Come see the PriPara concert near the front gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.02,0:12:03.11,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Let's get hyped up!{Don't do drugs, kids.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.59,0:12:06.20,PriPara,,0,0,0,,PriPara concert?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.65,0:12:08.57,PriPara,,0,0,0,,It's not canceled?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.57,0:12:09.38,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.38,0:12:10.26,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Let's go too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.26,0:12:11.26,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.26,0:12:13.12,PriPara,,0,0,0,,H-Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.65,0:12:16.51,PriPara,,0,0,0,,No one will make it past this line!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.46,0:12:21.56,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Right this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.56,0:12:23.05,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The show's over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.05,0:12:24.22,PriPara,,0,0,0,,You there! No pushing-chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.79,0:12:29.14,PriPara,,0,0,0,,You kids! Return at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.75,0:12:34.10,PriPara,,0,0,0,,PriPara concert! I authorized no such thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.68,0:12:39.28,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Th-They have a permit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.48,0:12:41.49,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Permit?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.49,0:12:47.39,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Th-The event is outside school grounds. Outside the bounds of the Principal's rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.39,0:12:50.86,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Just whose permit does this have then?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.86,0:12:51.95,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The police!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.29,0:12:53.64,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Police?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.17,0:12:58.90,Preoselawyer,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fscx105\fscy100\frz327.7\pos(269.334,278.666)\c&HFFFFFF&\t(0,250,1,\c&H66665F&)\t(2313,0,1,\alpha&HFF&)}Prosecutor
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.17,0:12:58.90,Preoselawyer,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fscx105\fscy100\frz11.22\pos(1081.333,301.333)\c&HFFFFFF&\t(0,250,1,\c&H66665F&)\t(2313,0,1,\alpha&HFF&)}Lawyer
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.64,0:12:58.84,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The event has all the proper permits in accordance with traffic law.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.84,0:13:01.13,PriPara,,0,0,0,,And here's the relevant paperwork!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.17,0:13:05.09,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I've been thoroughly blindsided!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.69,0:13:07.55,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The crowd is all ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.83,0:13:09.47,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Just as planned-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.05,0:13:11.88,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Where's it being shown?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.88,0:13:12.98,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.31,0:13:21.33,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The PriPara trailer has arrived-chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.33,0:13:23.10,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The plan went off without a hitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.10,0:13:24.57,PriPara,,0,0,0,,It's only just begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.09,0:13:26.80,PriPara,,0,0,0,,PriPara Trailer! Transform!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.80,0:13:29.49,PriPara,,0,0,0,,PriPara Trailer! {\t(\fs90}Transform!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.54,0:13:51.47,PriPara,,0,0,0,,We're all ready-chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.08,0:13:55.06,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Scan the appropriate amount of My Tickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.46,0:13:57.56,PriPara,,0,0,0,,You may also scan friend tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.98,0:14:00.60,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.18,0:14:08.82,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Dressing Pafé is using Fortune Party's number one seller, the Marching Star Coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.82,0:14:10.89,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Marching Star Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.08,0:14:17.41,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen of Paprika Academy, let's go wild!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.27,0:14:22.17,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Hi! Welcome to our PriPara concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.17,0:14:24.04,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Enjoy yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.04,0:14:27.80,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Dressing Pafé proudly presents:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.80,0:14:30.09,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Our new song: CHANGE! MY WORLD!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.09,0:14:32.41,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Shion!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.25,0:15:50.84,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Making Drama Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.35,0:15:59.82,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Girls and boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.34,0:16:02.92,PriPara,,0,0,0,,All the students at our school!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.92,0:16:04.98,PriPara,,0,0,0,,They're having fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.98,0:16:06.80,PriPara,,0,0,0,,That's wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.80,0:16:09.33,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Full-speed Dash!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.33,0:16:12.15,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Fly! Balloons!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.82,0:16:18.25,PriPara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.78,0:16:24.46,PriPara,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Go!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.46,0:16:25.38,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.39,0:17:09.43,PriPara,,0,0,0,,SoLaMi SMILE's new coords are based on festival snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.33,0:17:14.42,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Cotton Candy Fluff Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.42,0:17:17.43,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Popcorn Pompom Coord! Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.43,0:17:19.75,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Chocolate Cream Blend Coord!{At first I was like "Chocolate Cream Mixup" but then it sounded kind of scatological.}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.79,0:17:24.82,PriPara,,0,0,0,,The show ain't over yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.82,0:17:27.23,PriPara,,0,0,0,,SoLaMi SMILE is here-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.23,0:17:29.90,PriPara,,0,0,0,,With our new song, Happy Hop Lucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.68,0:18:51.10,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Making Drama Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.05,0:18:56.15,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Twirly twirl!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.68,0:18:57.24,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Sparkly sparkle!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.95,0:19:04.87,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Deliver them to everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.87,0:19:06.77,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Our feelings!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.77,0:19:09.21,PriPara,,0,0,0,,And this complimentary Red Flash pizza!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.87,0:19:14.39,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Exciting... Present For You!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.91,0:19:18.26,PriPara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.67,0:19:58.25,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Lala!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.25,0:19:59.67,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Sophie!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.98,0:20:05.10,PriPara,,0,0,0,,PriPara...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.68,0:20:08.28,PriPara,,0,0,0,,M-My heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.52,0:20:15.48,PriPara,,0,0,0,,S-Stop this at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.13,0:20:18.96,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Return to school grounds at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.96,0:20:20.65,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Return at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.65,0:20:22.48,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Lady Sophie!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.48,0:20:23.36,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.32,0:20:27.87,PriPara,,0,0,0,,PriPara?! Friends?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.77,0:20:39.38,PriPara,,0,0,0,,{\i1}One day...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.01,0:20:43.24,PriPara,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even the headmistress will understand.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.78,0:20:47.99,PriPara,,0,0,0,,So it was another tie, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.99,0:20:50.17,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I'm glad they enjoyed us both.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.17,0:20:52.06,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.49,0:20:57.81,PriPara,,0,0,0,,But we'll settle this yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.81,0:20:59.40,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Now your talking my language-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.91,0:21:06.62,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I see how it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.62,0:21:10.16,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I have been too soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.50,0:21:12.83,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Time to take decisive action!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.07,0:21:18.08,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Until all trace of PriPara is gone from the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.08,0:21:22.05,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I'll definitely crush it this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.50,0:21:26.66,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Definitely! Definitely! Definitely! Definitely!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.66,0:21:28.01,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Definitely! Definitely!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.44,0:21:33.16,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Remember PriPara!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.04,0:23:08.03,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Remember PriPara.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.03,0:23:10.32,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I've made my decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.32,0:23:14.33,PriPara,,0,0,0,,I will erase the word PriPara from my school!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.62,0:23:17.91,PriPara,,0,0,0,,What? Ookanda is becoming the middle school's principal too?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.91,0:23:19.92,PriPara,,0,0,0,,To all students:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.92,0:23:23.79,PriPara,,0,0,0,,From now on, going to PriPara is forbidden for all students!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.79,0:23:27.39,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Oh no! No one will be able to go to PriPara!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.44,0:23:32.65,PriPara,,0,0,0,,Next time: The Last Day of PriPara!
