Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.59,0:18:03.31,SalamiSong2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Whenever you're sad, listen to those tears
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.31,0:18:09.48,SalamiSong2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,"Don't worry, I'm right here" you reassured me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.50,0:18:15.32,SalamiSong2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,And when we're happy, and our hearts race
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.32,0:18:21.48,SalamiSong2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,You told me that eggs of new dreams will be born
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.48,0:18:25.70,SalamiSong2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Love you, love you lots
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.70,0:18:27.66,SalamiSong2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.66,0:18:30.29,SalamiSong2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,From "maybe" to "definitely"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.29,0:18:34.96,SalamiSong2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,This change we can't stop
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.96,0:18:39.18,SalamiSong2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,With a running start hopscotch hopscotch happy heart
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.18,0:18:42.01,SalamiSong2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Hopscotch happy hop lucky
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.01,0:18:45.31,SalamiSong2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Off-balance and on the ground
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.31,0:18:48.60,SalamiSong2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,But never give up, Divine Idols
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.98,0:18:53.94,SalamiSong2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,We're going all the way, so cheer us on
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.52,0:19:00.13,SalamiSong2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Running all the way, until our legs give out
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.13,0:19:02.53,SalamiSong2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Bumping head first into everything
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.53,0:19:06.04,SalamiSong2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,So don't fall behind
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.04,0:19:11.88,SalamiSong2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Roll our good times into a nice tight bundle
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.88,0:19:14.38,SalamiSong2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Polish it to a shine
