Dialogue: 4,0:14:38.98,0:14:41.78,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's make dreams! We can do it!
Dialogue: 4,0:14:41.78,0:14:44.40,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's make dreams! Change my world!
Dialogue: 4,0:14:44.40,0:14:48.07,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,There's no turning back once we start
Dialogue: 4,0:14:49.57,0:14:55.08,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Looking for a new world, and I know we'll find one
Dialogue: 4,0:14:55.08,0:15:00.25,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Once we start having fun I just know we can't stop
Dialogue: 4,0:15:00.25,0:15:04.84,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,As long as we're together I can dance too
Dialogue: 4,0:15:04.84,0:15:07.71,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,The door of dreams
Dialogue: 4,0:15:07.71,0:15:13.18,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,It will open for the three of us, I believe it will
Dialogue: 4,0:15:13.18,0:15:15.51,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,So here we go
Dialogue: 4,0:15:15.51,0:15:17.18,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Our secret passion
Dialogue: 4,0:15:17.19,0:15:21.52,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Will turn our "run-of-the-mill" into miracles
Dialogue: 4,0:15:21.52,0:15:22.86,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on along
Dialogue: 4,0:15:22.86,0:15:23.94,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 4,0:15:23.94,0:15:27.67,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,400)}To our magical PARTY TIME
Dialogue: 4,0:15:29.25,0:15:32.41,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,You and me, we all have one
Dialogue: 4,0:15:32.41,0:15:34.95,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,A place where we can really shine
Dialogue: 4,0:15:34.95,0:15:36.20,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Want to change things?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:36.20,0:15:37.40,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Make a wish
Dialogue: 4,0:15:37.40,0:15:38.04,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Look for it
Dialogue: 4,0:15:38.04,0:15:39.92,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,A feeling from deep within
Dialogue: 4,0:15:39.92,0:15:40.60,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Make it true
Dialogue: 4,0:15:40.60,0:15:42.98,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,The true smile you hid
Dialogue: 4,0:15:42.98,0:15:44.36,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Can't be held back anymore
Dialogue: 4,0:15:44.36,0:15:45.75,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,No one can
Dialogue: 4,0:15:45.75,0:15:47.72,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Give in to the passion and
Dialogue: 4,0:15:47.72,0:15:48.22,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Sing! Sing!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:48.22,0:15:50.84,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's sing together
Dialogue: 4,0:15:50.84,0:15:56.48,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)}I'm changing! My way!
